      </resprocessing>
      <itemfeedback ident="45643_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">The distinction between process and product tasks is not about individual vs. group work, word count, or grading method. A process task is one where the learning happens in the doing, such as revising a thesis or tightening a sentence. A product task focuses on the finished result, such as formatting a document. Writing assignments in this course are process tasks because the skill lives in the decisions you make as a writer, not in the document you submit.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="96939_fb">
        <flow_mat>
