        </respcondition>
      </resprocessing>
      <itemfeedback ident="54347_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Wordiness occurs when a sentence uses more words than necessary to communicate its meaning. The phrase "due to the fact that there are a large number of students who are in the process of learning" can be shortened to "because many students are learning" without losing any meaning. The other options are already concise and direct.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
