        </respcondition>
      </resprocessing>
      <itemfeedback ident="84247_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">When AI guidelines are unclear, the reading instructs you to choose the approach that requires more of your own effort. This choice is always consistent with the spirit of the course, even if the specific policy is not stated. Following a classmate's choice, using AI and noting it, or skipping the assignment are not the approaches the course recommends.</mattext>
