        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">A thesis statement does not list evidence, provide background, or summarize other writers' views. Its purpose is to tell the reader what topic you are writing about and what specific position or angle you take. It acts as a roadmap that keeps the entire essay focused.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
