      <itemfeedback ident="81203_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">The reading states that scientific writing relies heavily on logos because it depends on facts, data, and reasoning. Personal narratives often use pathos because they connect with readers through stories and emotional experiences. The other options reverse or misrepresent these relationships as described in the reading.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
