        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">A transition is a word or phrase that connects ideas and helps writing flow smoothly from one thought to the next. It is not a full sentence, a punctuation mark, or a summary. Transitions guide readers through a piece of writing by showing relationships between ideas, such as contrast, sequence, or cause and effect.</mattext>
